## 💻 LeetCode SQL Practice

**Problem:** Customers Who Never Order

**SQL concepts:**
- LEFT JOIN
- Filtering unmatched records using IS NULL

**MySQL solution:**

```sql
SELECT name AS Customers
FROM Customers AS c
LEFT JOIN Orders AS o
    ON c.id = o.customerId
WHERE o.customerId IS NULL;
```

